1|0@DotA2^1440672449#cuhbcyp:zeruf$:When you get more intellect, your mana pool stays at the same percent. So if you drop 6 points of intellect on the ground, your mana pool is lower, therefore 150 mana is now a higher percentage of your overall mana, so when you pick the 6 points back up, you keep the higher overall percentage.
