1|0@DotA2^1440675230#cuhc5vi:AlinValentin$:When you pick up items that give mana or int, your mana stays at the same percent. If you have 125 / 250 mana (50%) and you pick up Arcane boots, you will have 250 / 500 mana (same 50%). If you use soul ring at 250 / 500 mana, you will have 400/500 mana. If you use the soul ring when you have 125 / 250 mana, you will have 275/275 (100%) mana. Pick up the arcane boots and you get to 525 / 525 (same 100%) mana. In this unrealistic example you just gained 125 mana because you dropped and picked up your boots.
